nistration Supervision (#092) Search Popular Searches DegreeWorks Request a Transcript Academic Advising Admissions & Aid Admissions & Aid Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions Visit Campus / Campus Tours Tuition & Fees Financial Aid Scholarships Apply Now Admissions Events Transfer Students International Admissions What Can we help you find? Search Search Popular Searches Campus Tours Application Scholarships Student Life Student Life Housing & Residence Life Dining Services Student Activities & Clubs Campus Events Calendar Health & Wellness Services Career Success Center Diversity & Inclusion Campus Safety Student Government Counseling Center What Can we help you find? Search Search Popular Searches Athletics Bookstore Commencement Athletics Athletics Athletics Home Schedules Facilities & Venues Athletic Staff Directory Intramural Sports Hall of Fame What Can we help you find? Search Search Popular Searches Master schedule Recreation Facilities About About President's Welcome History & Mission Fast Facts Leadership & Administration Campus Map & Directions News & Announcements Accreditation & Rankings Strategic Plan Employment Opportunities Contact Us What Can we help you find? Search Search Popular Searches President Bernal Maps & Directions Career Opportunities WolvesNet Essentials Blackboard Email Browse Classes Phone Directory Library Office365 Tutoring Events IT Support Resources For Prospective Students Current Students Faculty & Staff Parents Alumni Donors Community Wolves Fans Veterans Español/Português Automatic translation disclaimer Translation of this page is provided by the third-party Google Translate service. In case of dispute, the original language content should prevail. La traducción de esta página la proporciona el servicio Google Translate de terceros. En caso de disputa, prevalecerá el contenido del idioma original. La traduction de cette page est fournie par le service tiers Google Translate. En cas de litige, le contenu de la langue originale prévaudra. Request Info Visit Apply Give Toggle search What Can we help you find? Search Search Popular Searches Academic Calendar Commencement Majors & Minors WCSU Request Info Visit Apply Give Human Resources > Adjunct Appointment Process In This Site In This Site Human Resources Department Information HR Announcements Employment Opportunities Benefits Policies and Procedures Human Resources – Forms Full Time Employees Part Time Employees Labor Relations Information Title IX Adjunct Appointment Process Student Employment Core-CT Self-Service Adjunct Appointment Process ADJUNCT APPOINTMENT PROCESS Adjunct Employment Appointment Workflow App (online app for hiring adjunct employees Training Session Videos: Adjunct Appointment Form APP Training Session Video from November 9, 2023 Adjunct Appointment Form APP Training Session Video from November 8, 2023 HR Contact For Questions & Assistance: Vicky Cook – 203-837-8678  Email: cookv@wcsu.edu WCSU WCSU WCSU Logo Contact Us 181 White St. Danbury, Conn.  06810 admissions@wcsu.edu 203-837-9000 Instagram Facebook LinkedIn X YouTube Flickr Future Students Current Students Alumni & Parents Faculty & Staff Donors & Friends Wolves Sports Fans A to Z Index Maps & Directions Academics Athletics Blackboard Learn Email WolvesNet Contact the University Phone Directory Anonymous Incident Report Copyright @ 2026 Western Connecticut State University Privacy Discrimination & Title IX Complaint Accessibility Secret Link"
